    "section": "20. Strategic Reserves",
    "ruleNumber": "20.00",
    "summary": "Units can enter play from reserves after being held back at deployment or through a special ability. This chapter explains [which units can be held back](vsdata:core-rule/placing-units-in-strategic-reserves), how [repositioned units](vsdata:core-rule/repositioned-units) are treated and [how units arrive](vsdata:core-rule/arriving-from-strategic-reserves) with an [Ingress move](vsdata:core-rule/ingress-move).",
